Third-party notice: Lumen

Opal began as a Rust rewrite of Lumen 0.1.0 ("lumen-launcher", described by its
authors as "a glassmorphic app launcher that lives on your Windows wallpaper").
Its themes, widget designs, glass rendering recipe and the film-grain texture
(ui/grain.png in the Tauri edition) are derived from that application.

Lumen 0.1.0 declares the MIT license in its package.json. The distribution this
work was based on shipped no separate license file and no copyright notice, so
no author name can be reproduced here; all rights in the original work remain
with the Lumen authors under the MIT license above.

The Vietnamese lunar calendar code follows the algorithm published by
Hồ Ngọc Đức.
